14:39.532 --> 14:41.022
Chin chin kamo kamo!

14:51.210 --> 14:52.879
Interview?

14:52.879 --> 14:55.581
Boy, sounds like a pain...

14:55.581 --> 14:57.383
You don't like to be interviewed?

14:57.383 --> 15:00.353
No. It takes time, and the finished materials
never quite reflect my true intention,

15:00.353 --> 15:03.523
