17:22.328 --> 17:22.795
Answer! Because he was stuck on the lid!

17:22.795 --> 17:25.765
Answer! Because he was stuck on the lid!

17:27.667 --> 17:29.769
Oww... That's weird.

17:29.769 --> 17:31.904
